00:00:33.180 --> 00:00:34.992
(laughing)

00:00:34.992 --> 00:00:35.990
Pretty dusty.

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:37.767
- This has Jar Jar Binks all over it.

00:00:37.767 --> 00:00:39.275
