00:00:39.275 --> 00:00:40.530
- I think at the time
they actually thought

00:00:40.530 --> 00:00:42.027
people would like Jar Jar Binks

00:00:42.027 --> 00:00:43.385
before the movie came out.

00:00:43.385 --> 00:00:44.686
They were wrong

00:00:44.686 --> 00:00:46.267
in the biggest way possible.

00:00:46.267 --> 00:00:48.206
- (laughs) Look at the color of this.

00:00:48.206 --> 00:00:49.285
- Holy (beep).

00:00:49.285 --> 00:00:50.573
- Dude, it's like parchment paper.

00:00:50.573 --> 00:00:52.907
