00:01:01.962 --> 00:01:04.841
- What's on the paper?
- [Man] Oh my God.

00:01:04.841 --> 00:01:07.383
- No, it tastes fine.
- [Man] It smells terrible,

00:01:07.383 --> 00:01:08.382
