00:01:08.382 --> 00:01:09.484
- Hmm. Smells nice.

00:01:09.484 --> 00:01:10.785
- I don't know about that.

00:01:10.785 --> 00:01:12.863
It's like nice with a
little bit of rotten.

00:01:12.863 --> 00:01:15.382
- Oh!

00:01:15.382 --> 00:01:17.610
It smells like grandpa's shoes.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:20.450
