00:01:47.088 --> 00:01:50.276
- I don't know, I don't know about this.

00:01:51.883 --> 00:01:54.146
- Dust (blows out air).

00:01:54.146 --> 00:01:55.680
Ancient artifacts.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.582
